        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MP40, Small Manhattan Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Manhattan Cabinet Pull has classic design that has a been rejuvenated for modern homes. This solid brass kitchen cabinet pull is a statement piece, setting the tone of contemporary elegance for your space. The Small Manhattan Cabinet Door Pull is available in the most popular finish colors. It comes packaged with the installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP40-specifications.gif?v=1704354588\" width=\"600\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MP40 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/7-inch-manhattan-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp70\"><b>Deltana MP70 7\" Manhattan Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP40-installed.jpg?v=1704354589\" width=\"295\" height=\"244\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana MP40 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Manhattan Kitchen Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount: 21/32\" square</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP40-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Deltana MP40 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
